# Copy to .env.local and adjust.

# Dev server only: where /kyc-api is forwarded (the KYC FastAPI service).
KYC_API_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# Base URL the site sends KYC requests to. Leave unset to use /kyc-api
# (the dev proxy above). For a deployed KYC server, set its origin, e.g.
#   VITE_KYC_API_URL=https://kyc.example.com
# and add this site's origin to the server's KYC_CORS_ORIGINS.
# VITE_KYC_API_URL=
